    {
      "version": 1,
      "id_scheme_version": 1,
      "article_id": "a1_a7df8000e843c25e84bf94e7",
      "headline": "NVIDIA Accelerates AI on DGX & RTX Systems With New Open Models, LTX 2.5 Video Gen Support: 2x Performance Boost, Big Memory Savings, 5090 With 200 Tokens/s In Meta’s Muse",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "NVIDIA has released some major updates for DGX & RTX systems supporting new open models such as Nemotron 3.5, LTX 2.5 & more.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-12T08:03:39.332743+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "5fdbea8bd3224d69d627d7499ba1926773cbe6af2ecafbfd0b1b8ccec482d848",
          "excerpt": "NVIDIA has released some major updates for DGX & RTX systems supporting new open models such as Nemotron 3.5, LTX 2.5 & more.",
          "sentence_hash": "a6b7028b4818f3370ad658ed8349bc8c0b2527d11ed820e012dd91e69c37fa18",
          "anchors": [
            "open",
            "new open"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "These updates target NVIDIA's DGX and RTX platforms with faster performance and optimizations to accelerate Open AI models, and add new capabilities on these platforms, for further enrichment of the PC platform.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-12T08:03:39.332797+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "5fdbea8bd3224d69d627d7499ba1926773cbe6af2ecafbfd0b1b8ccec482d848",
          "excerpt": "These updates target NVIDIA's DGX and RTX platforms with faster performance and optimizations to accelerate Open AI models, and add new capabilities on these platforms, for further enrichment of the PC platform.",
          "sentence_hash": "7f70bbdc312412993aba59173fb65fd5ff574325bbb1b8bd3ea72ed778c4afe2",
          "anchors": [
            "these",
            "get"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "- Get more from DGX Spark — Google Chrome is coming as a native ARM64 Linux build, and the new NVIDIA Sync Resource Monitor will provide real-time and historical CPU and GPU views across one system or an entire cluster.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-12T08:03:39.332865+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "5fdbea8bd3224d69d627d7499ba1926773cbe6af2ecafbfd0b1b8ccec482d848",
          "excerpt": "- Get more from DGX Spark — Google Chrome is coming as a native ARM64 Linux build, and the new NVIDIA Sync Resource Monitor will provide real-time and historical CPU and GPU views across one system or an entire cluster.",
          "sentence_hash": "667096fec12abc3bfb9a185f59455dcc417e9a51dd0dfb63214845af1acb7c54",
          "anchors": [
            "pro"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "- Run Meta’s Muse Glimmer locally — the 30B open-weight model is optimized for always-on local agents, with more than 200 tokens per second on an RTX 5090.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-12T08:03:39.332904+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "5fdbea8bd3224d69d627d7499ba1926773cbe6af2ecafbfd0b1b8ccec482d848",
          "excerpt": "- Run Meta’s Muse Glimmer locally — the 30B open-weight model is optimized for always-on local agents, with more than 200 tokens per second on an RTX 5090.",
          "sentence_hash": "e6037c7ed9f5af82c2c66c63ec1eec83611954551b9edaa29046d926b1362d23",
          "anchors": [
            "gen",
            "open"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "- Create high-quality video locally with LTX-2.5 — the open video model adds multishot generation and generative editing, with a 2x performance boost and 40% memory savings on NVIDIA RTX GPUs, DGX Spark, and DGX Station.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-12T08:03:39.332948+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "5fdbea8bd3224d69d627d7499ba1926773cbe6af2ecafbfd0b1b8ccec482d848",
          "excerpt": "- Create high-quality video locally with LTX-2.5 — the open video model adds multishot generation and generative editing, with a 2x performance boost and 40% memory savings on NVIDIA RTX GPUs, DGX Spark, and DGX Station.",
          "sentence_hash": "9eace1f93a422171f545a824deb67ab9fa861396394c9a851a9e1f6a6b1790ab",
          "anchors": [
            "gen",
            "open",
            "40%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "- Explore more open models accelerated by NVIDIA — including Cosmos 3 Edge, MiniMax-H3, Poolside’s Laguna S 2.1, DeepSeek-V4-Flash, Thinking Machines Lab’s Inkling-Small, Unsloth Desktop, and Wan-Animate-2.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-12T08:03:39.332989+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "5fdbea8bd3224d69d627d7499ba1926773cbe6af2ecafbfd0b1b8ccec482d848",
          "excerpt": "- Explore more open models accelerated by NVIDIA — including Cosmos 3 Edge, MiniMax-H3, Poolside’s Laguna S 2.1, DeepSeek-V4-Flash, Thinking Machines Lab’s Inkling-Small, Unsloth Desktop, and Wan-Animate-2.",
          "sentence_hash": "dc04838be3d2eb819facbb022c9a979f370e214fd6c9e10727f54113d0f35ad1",
          "anchors": [
            "open"
          ]
        }
      ],
